{
 "@language_name": "简体中文",
 "  •  {bullet_text}": "  •  {bullet_text}",
 " across {pages} pages": "，共{pages}页",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — read this same stripe again.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Skip Stripe</b> — leave this stripe unread for now and jump to the next unread one. You can come back to it later in this session.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Save Partial &amp; Quit</b> — stop here and save what you have read so far. Next time you load this chart, <i>Continue Measurement</i> will pick up where you left off.": "&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 再次读取这一条。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>跳过色条</b> — 暂时不读这一条，跳到下一条未读的。你可以在本次会话中稍后回来读它。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>保存部分并退出</b> — 到此为止，保存目前已读取的内容。下次加载这张色卡时，<i>继续测量</i>会从你停下的地方接着进行。",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• connected to your Mac via USB<br>": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已通过USB连接到你的Mac<br>",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• connected to your Windows PC via USB<br>": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已通过USB连接到你的Windows电脑<br>",
 "&nbsp;&nbsp;• switched on<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• not in use by another application<br><br>Once the instrument is ready, press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "&nbsp;&nbsp;• 已开机<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 未被其他应用占用<br><br>仪器就绪后，请再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "'{name}' already exists in:\n  {folder}\n\nOverwrite it?": "'{name}' 已存在于:\n  {folder}\n\n要覆盖它吗？",
 "(empty path)": "（路径为空）",
 "(needs 3+ files)": "（需要3个以上文件）",
 "-{flag}": "-{flag}",
 ".ti3 test data file:": ".ti3 测试数据文件:",
 "1 colour from “{name}” is ready to add.": "来自“{name}”的1种颜色已准备好添加。",
 "1 page": "1页",
 "1 patch selected.": "已选中1个色块。",
 "1 spacer selected.": "已选中1个间隔条。",
 "1. Create Chart": "1. 创建色卡",
 "16-bit": "16位",
 "16-bit TIFF": "16位TIFF",
 "2. Print Chart": "2. 打印色卡",
 "3. Measure": "3. 测量",
 "3D difference map": "3D差异图",
 "3D distribution…": "3D分布…",
 "4. Build Profile": "4. 生成配置文件",
 "4. Calibration & Profiling": "4. 校准与配置文件",
 "5. Check & Refine": "5. 检查与优化",
 "8-bit": "8位",
 "<b>-I &nbsp; Embed calibration without applying</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>The .cal is embedded in the .ti2 as metadata only; patch values are left untouched. Use this when your printer or RIP already applies linearisation natively (e.g. EFI Fiery, Wasatch, or any RIP with its own LUT). colprof will reference the .cal when building the profile.</span>": "<b>-I &nbsp; 嵌入校准但不应用</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>.cal 仅作为元数据嵌入 .ti2；色块值保持不变。当你的打印机或RIP本身已应用线性化（如EFI Fiery、Wasatch或任何自带LUT的RIP）时使用。colprof在生成配置文件时会引用该 .cal。</span>",
 "<b>-K &nbsp; Apply calibration to patches</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>printtarg remaps every patch value through the .cal curves before printing. Use this when your printer has no built-in linearisation — the chart will already reflect calibrated device behaviour. Recommended for most desktop inkjet printers driven directly from a TIFF.</span>": "<b>-K &nbsp; 将校准应用到色块</b><br><span style='color:#b0b0b0; font-size:11px'>printtarg在打印前把每个色块值都通过 .cal 曲线重新映射。当你的打印机没有内置线性化时使用 — 色卡将直接反映校准后的设备行为。推荐用于大多数直接由TIFF驱动的桌面喷墨打印机。</span>",
 "<b>1 strip has at least one patch above ΔE {limit:.1f} and should be re-measured:</b>": "<b>有1条色条至少有一个色块超过ΔE {limit:.1f}，应重新测量:</b>",
 "<b>All stripes have been read successfully.</b><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Build Profile</b> — finalise the measurement and go to the Build Profile tab.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the whole chart once more; the reads are averaged together to reduce instrument noise (saved as …_average).<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Re-read Stripes</b> — re-scan individual strips into this same measurement. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move, <b>n</b> for the next unread stripe, and <b>d</b> when done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>After <b>Measure again to average</b> the instrument is set up again — this can take a few seconds and may ask you to recalibrate before the next read starts, so a brief pause here is normal.</span>": "<b>所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>生成配置文件</b> — 完成测量并前往生成配置文件标签页。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把整张色卡再读一遍；多次读取会被平均，以降低仪器噪声（保存为 …_average）。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>重读色条</b> — 在同一份测量中重新扫描个别色条。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>选择<b>再测一次取平均</b>后，仪器会重新初始化 — 这可能需要几秒钟，并可能在下次读取开始前要求重新校准，所以这里稍有停顿是正常的。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes have been read successfully.</b><br><br>Click <b>Build Profile</b> to finalise the measurement and go directly to the Build Profile tab — the next and final step.<br><br>If you would like to re-read any stripe first, click <b>Re-read Stripes</b>. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move forward and back between stripes, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread stripe, and press <b>d</b> when you are done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>These instructions are always visible in the output log below.</span>": "<b>所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>点击<b>生成配置文件</b>完成测量并直接前往生成配置文件标签页 — 这是下一步，也是最后一步。<br><br>如果想先重读某条色条，点击<b>重读色条</b>。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间前后移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>这些说明始终显示在下方的输出日志中。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes of your calibration target have been read successfully.</b><br><br>The measurement data has been saved. The next step is to turn it into a <b>calibration file (.cal)</b> — click <b>Create Calibration File</b> to go directly to the <b>4. Calibration &amp; Profiling</b> tab, where the file path is already filled in and ready to go.<br><br>If you would like to re-read any stripe first, click <b>Re-read Stripes</b>. Use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move forward and back between stripes, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread stripe, and press <b>d</b> when you are done.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>These instructions are always visible in the output log below.</span>": "<b>校准目标的所有色条都已成功读取。</b><br><br>测量数据已保存。下一步是把它变成<b>校准文件（.cal）</b> — 点击<b>创建校准文件</b>直接前往<b>4. 校准与配置文件</b>标签页，那里文件路径已经填好，随时可以开始。<br><br>如果想先重读某条色条，点击<b>重读色条</b>。用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间前后移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>这些说明始终显示在下方的输出日志中。</span>",
 "<b>All stripes read — {n} reads of this chart are now saved.</b><br><br>Combining repeated reads of the same chart averages out instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Average all reads &amp; build</b> — combine all {n} reads into one measurement, then continue to Build Profile.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the whole chart once more and add it to the set.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Use last read only</b> — build from this most recent read and ignore the others.<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>After <b>Measure again to average</b> the instrument is set up again — this can take a few seconds and may ask you to recalibrate before the next read starts, so a brief pause here is normal.</span>": "<b>所有色条已读取 — 这张色卡现已保存{n}次读取。</b><br><br>合并同一张色卡的多次读取可以平均掉仪器噪声，提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>平均所有读取并生成</b> — 把全部{n}次读取合并为一份测量，然后继续生成配置文件。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把整张色卡再读一遍并加入集合。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>仅用最后一次读取</b> — 用最近这次读取生成，忽略其他读取。<br><br><span style='color:#909090;'>选择<b>再测一次取平均</b>后，仪器会重新初始化 — 这可能需要几秒钟，并可能在下次读取开始前要求重新校准，所以这里稍有停顿是正常的。</span>",
 "<b>All {n} target strip(s) have been re-measured successfully.</b><br><br>What would you like to do next?<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Build Profile</b> — saves the measurement and takes you straight to the Build Profile tab to create your updated ICC profile.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Continue Measuring Manually</b> — keeps chartread running so you can scan additional strips yourself. You will have <b>full manual control</b>: use <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> to move between strips, <b>n</b> to jump to the next unread one, and <b>d</b> when you are done. The automatic strip navigation is switched off for the rest of this session.": "<b>全部{n}条目标色条都已成功重新测量。</b><br><br>接下来想做什么？<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>生成配置文件</b> — 保存测量并直接带你前往生成配置文件标签页，创建更新后的ICC配置文件。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>继续手动测量</b> — 让chartread继续运行，你可以自己扫描更多色条。你将拥有<b>完全的手动控制</b>: 用 <b>f</b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<b>b</b> 在色条间移动，<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读的，完成后按 <b>d</b>。本次会话余下时间自动色条导航将关闭。",
 "<b>An unexpected color response was detected (ΔE {delta_e}).</b><br><br>This usually means the instrument was not aligned correctly with the stripe, was moved during the scan, or the wrong stripe was read. A ΔE this high indicates the measured colors are very far from what is expected.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Use Anyway</b> — accept the reading and continue. Only use this if you are sure the scan was correct.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — discard this reading, re-position your instrument carefully on the correct stripe, and try again.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Give Up</b> — stop the measurement without saving.": "<b>检测到异常的颜色响应（ΔE {delta_e}）。</b><br><br>这通常意味着仪器没有正确对准色条、扫描时被移动，或者读错了色条。这么高的ΔE说明测得的颜色与预期相差很远。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>仍然使用</b> — 接受这次读取并继续。只有当你确定扫描没问题时才用。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 丢弃这次读取，把仪器仔细对准正确的色条，再试一次。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>放弃</b> — 停止测量且不保存。",
 "<b>Apply Calibration</b> — bakes your calibration curves (.cal file) directly into the ICC profile. This means every colour-managed app will automatically apply the calibration without any extra steps. Use this after you have created a calibration file in the <i>Create Calibration File</i> module. The profile path is already pre-filled — just select your .cal file and run.": "<b>应用校准</b> — 把校准曲线（.cal文件）直接写入ICC配置文件。这样每个支持色彩管理的应用都会自动应用校准，无需任何额外步骤。在<i>创建校准文件</i>模块中创建校准文件之后使用。配置文件路径已预先填好 — 只需选择你的 .cal 文件并运行。",
 "<b>ArgyllCMS could not be found on your system.</b><br><br>ChromIQ requires ArgyllCMS to create and measure ICC profiles. It was not detected in any of the usual locations.<br><br><b>To install ArgyllCMS:</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. Download ArgyllCMS from <a href='https://www.argyllcms.com'>argyllcms.com</a><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Extract the archive and move the folder to <span style='font-family:Menlo, Consolas, \"Courier New\", monospace'>/Applications</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Restart ChromIQ — it will detect the installation automatically.<br><br>If ArgyllCMS is already installed in a custom location, click <b>Open Preferences</b> to set the path manually.": "<b>在你的系统上找不到ArgyllCMS。</b><br><br>ChromIQ需要ArgyllCMS来创建和测量ICC配置文件。在所有常见位置都没有检测到它。<br><br><b>安装ArgyllCMS:</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 从 <a href='https://www.argyllcms.com'>argyllcms.com</a> 下载ArgyllCMS<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 解压并把文件夹移动到 <span style='font-family:Menlo, Consolas, \"Courier New\", monospace'>/Applications</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 重启ChromIQ — 它会自动检测安装。<br><br>如果ArgyllCMS已安装在自定义位置，点击<b>打开偏好设置</b>手动设置路径。",
 "<b>Calibration applied successfully.</b>": "<b>校准应用成功。</b>",
 "<b>Calibration complete. The app will guide you to each strip.</b><br><br>There are <b>{n} strip(s)</b> to re-measure. The app will automatically navigate chartread to each one — <b>you do not need to press f or b yourself.</b>": "<b>校准完成。应用会引导你到每条色条。</b><br><br>有<b>{n}条色条</b>需要重新测量。应用会自动让chartread逐条导航 — <b>你不需要自己按 f 或 b。</b>",
 "<b>Calibration complete. You are ready to re-measure strips manually.</b><br><br>chartread is resuming from your existing measurement. Re-scan any strip to overwrite it, or scan unread strips to fill them in — follow the steps below to pick which one.": "<b>校准完成。你可以开始手动重新测量色条了。</b><br><br>chartread正从你已有的测量继续。重新扫描任何色条即可覆盖它，或扫描未读的色条来补全 — 按下面的步骤选择目标色条。",
 "<b>Calibration complete. You are ready to start measuring.</b><br><br>Place your instrument at the beginning of the first stripe and trigger it to scan. Then proceed stripe by stripe until all are done.": "<b>校准完成。你可以开始测量了。</b><br><br>把仪器放在第一条色条的起点并触发扫描。然后逐条进行，直到全部完成。",
 "<b>Check Profile Quality</b> — runs a quality check to see how accurately the profile represents your printer's colours. Recommended before using the profile for critical prints.": "<b>检查配置文件质量</b> — 运行质量检查，看配置文件对打印机色彩的还原有多准确。建议在用该配置文件做重要打印之前进行。",
 "<b>First strip: {first}</b> — place your instrument there and scan when ready.": "<b>第一条色条: {first}</b> — 把仪器放在那里，准备好后开始扫描。",
 "<b>Install Profile</b> — copies the calibrated profile to your system's colour profile directory so it is immediately available in colour-managed applications.": "<b>安装配置文件</b> — 把校准后的配置文件复制到系统的色彩配置文件目录，使其立即可用于支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install Profile</b> — copies the profile to your system's colour profile directory so it is immediately available in colour-managed applications.": "<b>安装配置文件</b> — 把配置文件复制到系统的色彩配置文件目录，使其立即可用于支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install on this Mac</b> — adds the calibrated profile to your Mac's colour management system so it is immediately available in Photoshop, Lightroom, and other colour-managed apps.": "<b>安装到这台Mac</b> — 把校准后的配置文件加入Mac的色彩管理系统，使其立即可用于Photoshop、Lightroom及其他支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Install on this Mac</b> — adds the profile to your Mac's colour management system so it is immediately available in Photoshop, Lightroom, and other colour-managed apps.": "<b>安装到这台Mac</b> — 把配置文件加入Mac的色彩管理系统，使其立即可用于Photoshop、Lightroom及其他支持色彩管理的应用。",
 "<b>Measurement complete — your readings have been saved.</b><br><br>Reading the same chart a second time and averaging the two results reduces instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Continue to Build Profile</b> — use this single measurement as it is.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again to average</b> — read the same chart once more; the results will be averaged together.": "<b>测量完成 — 你的读取结果已保存。</b><br><br>把同一张色卡再读一遍并对两次结果取平均，可以降低仪器噪声、提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>继续生成配置文件</b> — 直接使用这一份测量。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次取平均</b> — 把同一张色卡再读一遍；结果将被平均。",
 "<b>Measurement complete — {n} reads of this chart are saved.</b><br><br>Combining repeated reads of the same chart averages out instrument noise and can improve profile accuracy.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Average all reads &amp; build</b> — combine all {n} reads into one measurement, then continue to Build Profile.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Use last read only</b> — build from the most recent read and ignore the others.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Measure again</b> — read the chart once more and add it to the set.": "<b>测量完成 — 这张色卡已保存{n}次读取。</b><br><br>合并同一张色卡的多次读取可以平均掉仪器噪声，提高配置文件精度。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>平均所有读取并生成</b> — 把全部{n}次读取合并为一份测量，然后继续生成配置文件。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>仅用最后一次读取</b> — 用最近这次读取生成，忽略其他读取。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>再测一次</b> — 把色卡再读一遍并加入集合。",
 "<b>No measurement instrument was detected.</b><br><br>Please make sure your instrument is:<br>": "<b>未检测到测量仪器。</b><br><br>请确认你的仪器:<br>",
 "<b>Patches with the highest error</b><br>(worst first, ΔE):<pre>{patch_lines}</pre>": "<b>误差最大的色块</b><br>（最差在前，ΔE）:<pre>{patch_lines}</pre>",
 "<b>Place sheet {sheet_n} of {total} on the XY table.</b><br><br>Press <b>Continue</b> when the sheet is positioned, or <b>Give Up</b> to stop without saving.": "<b>把第{sheet_n}页（共{total}页）放到XY平台上。</b><br><br>放好后按<b>继续</b>，或按<b>放弃</b>停止且不保存。",
 "<b>Stop measuring without saving?</b><br><br>Choose <b>Yes</b> to abort, or <b>No</b> to keep measuring.": "<b>停止测量且不保存？</b><br><br>选<b>是</b>中止，或选<b>否</b>继续测量。",
 "<b>Strips with the highest error</b><br>(worst first, avg ΔE):<pre>{strip_lines}</pre>": "<b>误差最大的色条</b><br>（最差在前，平均ΔE）:<pre>{strip_lines}</pre>",
 "<b>The chart is not fully measured yet.</b><br><br>At least one patch is still unread: <b>{patch_info}</b>.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Save Partial</b> — save what's been measured so far. You can resume later by ticking <i>Refine / resume existing measurement (-r)</i>.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Keep Measuring</b> — return to the strip menu and continue.": "<b>色卡尚未全部测完。</b><br><br>至少还有一个色块未读: <b>{patch_info}</b>。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>保存部分</b> — 保存目前已测量的内容。之后勾选<i>优化/恢复已有测量 (-r)</i>即可继续。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>继续测量</b> — 返回色条菜单接着测。",
 "<b>The colorimeter correction file could not be applied.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{err}</i><br><br>Check the path in <b>Settings → Argyll Options</b>, or remove the CCMX / CCSS reference from the extra-args field and try again.": "<b>无法应用色度计校正文件。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{err}</i><br><br>请检查<b>设置 → Argyll选项</b>中的路径，或从额外参数栏中移除CCMX / CCSS引用后重试。",
 "<b>The instrument could not be initialised.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{_b_init_msg}</i><br><br>Try the following:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Unplug and replug the USB cable<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Make sure the instrument is switched on<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Close any other application that might be using it<br><br>Then press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "<b>仪器无法初始化。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{_b_init_msg}</i><br><br>请尝试以下操作:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 拔下并重新插上USB线<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 确认仪器已开机<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;• 关闭可能占用它的其他应用<br><br>然后再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "<b>The instrument could not be opened — it is already in use by another process.</b><br><br>This usually happens when a previous measurement session was not stopped properly before closing the app. ChromIQ automatically tries to free the device when starting a new measurement.<br><br>Please click OK and then press <b>Start Measurement</b> again.": "<b>无法打开仪器 — 它已被另一个进程占用。</b><br><br>这通常是上一次测量会话在关闭应用前未正常停止造成的。ChromIQ在开始新测量时会自动尝试释放设备。<br><br>请点击「确定」，然后再次按<b>开始测量</b>。",
 "<b>The instrument lost communication with the computer.</b><br><br>Check that the instrument's cable is firmly connected (try a different USB port or cable), make sure no other application is using the device, then reconnect it before retrying.": "<b>仪器与电脑失去通信。</b><br><br>检查仪器线缆是否插牢（换个USB口或线缆试试），确认没有其他应用在使用该设备，然后重新连接再重试。",
 "<b>The instrument refused the requested measurement mode.</b><br><br>Argyll reported: <i>{err}</i><br><br>Check the instrument-specific flags in your settings (high-res, UV mode, scan tolerance, etc.) and try again.": "<b>仪器拒绝了请求的测量模式。</b><br><br>Argyll报告: <i>{err}</i><br><br>请检查设置中仪器相关的选项（高分辨率、UV模式、扫描容差等）后重试。",
 "<b>The measurement device is in the wrong position.</b><br><br>It looks like the instrument is still in its <b>calibration position</b> (sensor facing up or to the side). To scan a strip, it needs to be switched to <b>measuring position</b> (sensor facing down, resting on the paper).<br><br>How to fix it:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. Flip or slide the sensor head so it faces <b>downward</b>.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Place the instrument at the beginning of the strip.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Press <b>OK</b> — chartread is still waiting and you can scan straight away.": "<b>测量设备的位置不对。</b><br><br>看起来仪器还停在<b>校准位置</b>（传感器朝上或朝侧面）。要扫描色条，需要把它切换到<b>测量位置</b>（传感器朝下，贴在纸面上）。<br><br>解决方法:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 翻转或滑动传感头，使其朝<b>下</b>。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 把仪器放在色条的起点。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 按<b>确定</b> — chartread仍在等待，你可以马上开始扫描。",
 "<b>The measurement instrument was disconnected.</b><br><br>The measurement has been stopped automatically. Please check the USB connection, reconnect your instrument, and start a new measurement.": "<b>测量仪器已断开连接。</b><br><br>测量已自动停止。请检查USB连接，重新连接仪器，然后开始新的测量。",
 "<b>The strip read was stopped before it finished.</b><br><br>This usually happens if the instrument switch is pressed mid-scan or if scanning is interrupted by another process.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Resume</b> — chartread is still waiting; re-position the instrument at the start of the current strip and continue.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Give Up</b> — stop the measurement without saving.": "<b>色条读取在完成前被中断。</b><br><br>这通常是扫描中途按到了仪器开关，或扫描被其他进程打断造成的。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>恢复</b> — chartread仍在等待；把仪器重新放到当前色条的起点继续。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>放弃</b> — 停止测量且不保存。",
 "<b>The stripe could not be read:</b> {reason}<br><br>Re-position your instrument at the beginning of the stripe and try again. If the error keeps occurring, try scanning more slowly and steadily, or raise the <i>Patch consistency tolerance</i> setting before the next run.": "<b>无法读取该色条:</b> {reason}<br><br>把仪器重新放到色条起点再试一次。如果错误持续出现，试着扫描得更慢更稳，或在下次运行前调高<i>色块一致性容差</i>设置。",
 "<b>This instrument cannot measure in {cap} mode.</b><br><br>ChromIQ measures printed test charts, which need a <b>reflection-capable</b> instrument (e.g. i1Pro, i1Pro 2, i1Pro 3, ColorMunki, SpectroScan).<br><br>Display-only colorimeters (e.g. i1Display) cannot read paper. Connect a reflection-capable instrument and try again.": "<b>此仪器无法以{cap}模式测量。</b><br><br>ChromIQ测量的是打印出的测试色卡，需要<b>支持反射测量</b>的仪器（如i1Pro、i1Pro 2、i1Pro 3、ColorMunki、SpectroScan）。<br><br>仅用于显示器的色度计（如i1Display）无法读取纸面。请连接支持反射测量的仪器后重试。",
 "<b>This reading looks like strip {read}, but strip {expected} was expected.</b><br><br>This usually means the instrument was placed on the wrong row — or two rows simply look very similar. You have three options:<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Use Anyway</b> — keep this reading and save it as strip {expected} (the row you were asked to scan). Only choose this if you are sure the instrument really was on strip {expected} and the warning is a false alarm — the reading is always filed under {expected}, not {read}.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — discard this reading and try again. Place your instrument on strip {expected} and re-scan.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Give Up</b> — stop the measurement without saving.": "<b>这次读取看起来像色条{read}，但预期是色条{expected}。</b><br><br>这通常意味着仪器放错了行 — 或者两行的颜色恰好非常相似。你有三个选择:<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>仍然使用</b> — 保留这次读取，并把它保存为色条{expected}（你被要求扫描的那一行）。只有当你确定仪器确实在色条{expected}上、警告是误报时才选这个 — 读取始终归档为{expected}，不是{read}。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 丢弃这次读取再试一次。把仪器放到色条{expected}上重新扫描。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>放弃</b> — 停止测量且不保存。",
 "<b>Use as pre-conditioning profile</b> — start a second profiling pass that uses this profile to place the new test patches more intelligently. The next chart will sample more in the colour regions your printer reproduces least accurately, producing a noticeably better profile on the second round. This profile and its measurements are kept intact in their own run folder so nothing is lost. Recommended once you've confirmed a working profile for this paper.": "<b>用作预调节配置文件</b> — 开始第二轮配置文件制作，利用这个配置文件更聪明地放置新测试色块。下一张色卡会在打印机还原最不准的颜色区域采样更多，第二轮就能得到明显更好的配置文件。此配置文件及其测量会完整保留在自己的运行文件夹中，不会丢失任何东西。建议在确认这种纸已有可用配置文件后使用。",
 "<b>Use as pre-conditioning profile</b> — start a second profiling pass that uses this profile to place the new test patches more intelligently. The next chart will sample more in the colour regions your printer reproduces least accurately, producing a noticeably better profile on the second round. Your existing chart files are preserved (renamed with a <code>pre_</code> prefix) so nothing is lost. Recommended once you've already built a working profile for this paper.": "<b>用作预调节配置文件</b> — 开始第二轮配置文件制作，利用这个配置文件更聪明地放置新测试色块。下一张色卡会在打印机还原最不准的颜色区域采样更多，第二轮就能得到明显更好的配置文件。你已有的色卡文件会被保留（重命名为 <code>pre_</code> 前缀），不会丢失任何东西。建议在已为这种纸做出可用配置文件后使用。",
 "<b>Warnings detected:</b>": "<b>检测到警告:</b>",
 "<b>Your ICC profile has been built successfully.</b>": "<b>你的ICC配置文件已成功生成。</b>",
 "<b>Your ICC profile has been built — with warnings.</b>": "<b>你的ICC配置文件已生成 — 但有警告。</b>",
 "<b>Your calibration file is ready.</b>": "<b>你的校准文件已就绪。</b>",
 "<b>Your instrument needs to be calibrated before measuring.</b><br><br>Place the instrument in the <b>calibration position</b> as described in its manual, then click <b>Start Calibration</b>.<br><br>The calibration takes only a few seconds. Once it is complete, another message will appear with instructions on how to start measuring the stripes.": "<b>测量前需要先校准仪器。</b><br><br>按说明书把仪器放到<b>校准位置</b>，然后点击<b>开始校准</b>。<br><br>校准只需几秒钟。完成后会出现另一条消息，说明如何开始测量色条。",
 "<b>Your measurement device could not be opened — it appears to be connected to a virtual machine.</b><br><br>When a device is assigned to a VM (Parallels, VMware, VirtualBox, etc.), the host operating system cannot access it at the same time.<br><br>To fix this:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. In your VM software, disconnect the device from the virtual machine<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Reconnect the USB cable if needed<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. Press <b>Start Measurement</b> again": "<b>无法打开测量设备 — 它似乎被连接到了虚拟机。</b><br><br>当设备被分配给虚拟机（Parallels、VMware、VirtualBox等）时，宿主操作系统无法同时访问它。<br><br>解决方法:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 在虚拟机软件中把设备从虚拟机断开<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 必要时重新插一次USB线<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 再次按<b>开始测量</b>",
 "<b>n</b> jumps to the next unread strip  —  <b>Esc / q</b> quits without saving.": "<b>n</b> 跳到下一条未读色条  —  <b>Esc / q</b> 退出且不保存。",
 "<b>{friendly}</b><br><span style='color:#888;'>({technical})</span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Retry</b> — try the operation again.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Give Up</b> — stop the measurement without saving.": "<b>{friendly}</b><br><span style='color:#888;'>（{technical}）</span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>重试</b> — 再试一次该操作。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>放弃</b> — 停止测量且不保存。",
 "<b>{name}</b> is already in your working folder.<br><br>What would you like to do?": "<b>{name}</b> 已在你的工作文件夹中。<br><br>你想怎么做？",
 "<b>{n} strips have at least one patch above ΔE {limit:.1f} and should be re-measured:</b>": "<b>有{n}条色条至少有一个色块超过ΔE {limit:.1f}，应重新测量:</b>",
 "<b>{reason}</b><br><br>Re-measuring individual strips is unlikely to reliably fix this. <b>Starting over with a freshly printed and measured chart is strongly recommended.</b>": "<b>{reason}</b><br><br>重新测量个别色条很难可靠地解决这个问题。<b>强烈建议重新打印并测量一张新色卡，从头再来。</b>",
 "<br>If the instrument is connected but still not found, make sure the Argyll WinUSB driver is installed for your device (use Argyll's ArgyllInstallers tool or Zadig). See the Argyll documentation for details.": "<br>如果仪器已连接却仍然找不到，请确认已为你的设备安装Argyll WinUSB驱动（使用Argyll的ArgyllInstallers工具或Zadig）。详见Argyll文档。",
 "<i>Continue</i> — convert and use the measurement in this folder as-is — nothing will be copied or moved.": "<i>继续</i> — 直接转换并使用此文件夹中的测量 — 不会复制或移动任何内容。",
 "<i>Continue</i> — use the files in this folder as-is — nothing will be copied or moved.": "<i>继续</i> — 直接使用此文件夹中的文件 — 不会复制或移动任何内容。",
 "<i>Use as base for a new profile</i> — copy the files to a new subfolder so you can build a separate ICC profile without overwriting the original.": "<i>用作新配置文件的基础</i> — 把文件复制到新的子文件夹，这样你可以生成一个独立的ICC配置文件而不覆盖原文件。",
 "<i>Use as base for a new profile</i> — copy the measurement to a new subfolder so you can build a separate ICC profile without overwriting the original.": "<i>用作新配置文件的基础</i> — 把测量复制到新的子文件夹，这样你可以生成一个独立的ICC配置文件而不覆盖原文件。",
 "<span style='color:#606060; font-size:11px'>-K and -I are mutually exclusive — enable only one at a time.</span>": "<span style='color:#606060; font-size:11px'>-K 和 -I 互斥 — 同一时间只能启用一个。</span>",
 "A covered by B: {pct:.1f}%": "A被B覆盖: {pct:.1f}%",
 "A covered by B: —": "A被B覆盖: —",
 "A multiplier on chartread's built-in patch consistency\nthreshold — not a delta-E value. chartread re-reads each patch\nand rejects strips where the readings disagree by more than\nthe threshold × this number.\n\nLower = stricter. A strict setting catches real problems early:\nclogged inkjet nozzles, low ink, dirty drum rollers, drifting\nlaser toner. On a healthy printer + spectrophotometer combo\nthe default of 0.7 leaves comfortable headroom; experienced\nusers on printerknowledge.com run 0.4 with i1 Pro 2 / 3.\n\nRaise to 0.8–1.5 if you get false \"inconsistent patch\" errors\non textured, matte, or fine-art papers — the surface itself\ncontributes real variance there. Values above 2 mostly mask\ngenuine issues; if you need them, fix the printer first.": "乘在chartread内置色块一致性阈值上的系数 — 不是ΔE值。\nchartread会复读每个色块，并拒绝读数差异超过「阈值 × 此数」\n的色条。\n\n越低越严格。严格的设置能尽早发现真正的问题: 喷墨喷嘴堵塞、\n墨量不足、硒鼓辊脏污、激光碳粉漂移。在健康的打印机 + 分光\n光度计组合上，默认的0.7留有充足余量；printerknowledge.com\n上的资深用户用i1 Pro 2 / 3时取0.4。\n\n如果在纹理纸、哑光纸或艺术纸上出现误报的「色块不一致」错误，\n可调高到0.8〜1.5 — 那里纸面本身就会带来真实的差异。超过2的\n值大多只是掩盖真正的问题；如果你需要那么高，先把打印机修好。",
 "A pre-conditioning pass produces a sharper second profile.": "预调节一轮能让第二个配置文件更精准。",
 "A result popup appears with three actions: install the profile to your system colour folder, jump to Check & Refine to inspect its accuracy, or feed it back as a pre-conditioning profile (workflow 2). You can dismiss the popup and come back to any of these later.": "结果弹窗提供三个操作: 把配置文件安装到系统色彩文件夹、跳到检查与优化查看其精度，或把它作为预调节配置文件再投入使用（工作流程2）。你可以先关掉弹窗，稍后再回来做其中任何一项。",
 "A short, descriptive name for this profiling session.\n\nThis name is used for the output folder and all generated files (chart, TIFF, measurements, ICC profile) throughout the entire workflow. Choose a name that lets you identify the correct files for your printer and paper combination at a glance.\n\nTip: combine your printer model, paper type, and instrument — e.g. Canon_Pro1000_Baryta_i1Pro3. Use underscores or dashes instead of spaces.": "为本次配置文件制作起一个简短、有描述性的名字。\n\n这个名字用于输出文件夹以及整个流程中生成的所有文件（色卡、TIFF、测量、ICC配置文件）。选一个能让你一眼认出对应打印机和纸张组合的名字。\n\n提示: 组合打印机型号、纸张类型和仪器 — 例如 Canon_Pro1000_Baryta_i1Pro3。用下划线或连字符代替空格。",
 "APPLY CALIBRATION": "应用校准",
 "About to send <b>1</b> page to your printer. Please confirm:": "即将向打印机发送<b>1</b>页。请确认:",
 "About to send <b>{pages}</b> pages to your printer. Please confirm:": "即将向打印机发送<b>{pages}</b>页。请确认:",
 "Absolute": "绝对",
 "Absolute Colorimetric": "绝对比色",
 "Absolute colorimetric (default)": "绝对比色（默认）",
 "Absolute colorimetric checks the profile's absolute colour\naccuracy including white-point, which is the standard for\nprinter profiling. Relative colorimetric normalises to\nthe media white point.": "绝对比色检验配置文件的绝对颜色精度（含白点），\n是打印机配置文件制作的标准。相对比色则归一化到\n纸张白点。",
 "Acceptable": "可接受",
 "Add a new patch with a chosen colour": "用选定的颜色新增一个色块",
 "Add measurement files": "添加测量文件",
 "Add measurements to merge in": "添加要合并的测量",
 "Add patches first to see their distribution.": "先添加色块才能查看其分布。",
 "Add the new colours": "添加新颜色",
 "Add to the beginning": "添加到开头",
 "Add to the end": "添加到末尾",
 "Added {n} patches at the beginning.": "已在开头添加{n}个色块。",
 "Added {n} patches at the end.": "已在末尾添加{n}个色块。",
 "Additional Options": "附加选项",
 "Additional measurements (.ti3) — their patches are appended:": "附加测量（.ti3）— 其色块将被追加:",
 "Adds extra cLUT grid points in shadow areas for better shadow gradation.\n1.0 = uniform grid (default).\nTry 1.5–2.0 for printers with complex shadow behaviour.": "在阴影区域增加额外的cLUT网格点，改善暗部层次。\n1.0 = 均匀网格（默认）。\n阴影表现复杂的打印机可试1.5〜2.0。",
 "Add…": "添加…",
 "Advanced": "高级",
 "Advanced Options": "高级选项",
 "Algorithm (-a):": "算法 (-a):",
 "All Stripes Read": "所有色条已读取",
 "All parameter values saved in this preset will be permanently removed. This cannot be undone.": "此预设中保存的所有参数值将被永久删除。此操作无法撤销。",
 "Also Use Pre-conditioning Measurement Data": "同时使用预调节测量数据",
 "Also use measurement data from the pre-conditioning profile": "同时使用预调节配置文件的测量数据",
 "Also write an i1Profiler workflow file (.pwxf)": "同时写出i1Profiler工作流程文件 (.pwxf)",
 "An optional ownership or copyright note saved inside the profile. Reach for it if you'd like to record who created the profile, or set out how others may use it — useful when you share profiles publicly.\n\nIt's informational only and has no effect on colour, so most people can happily leave it switched off.\n\nExample: \"© 2026 Your Name. All rights reserved.\"": "保存在配置文件内的可选所有权或版权说明。如果你想记录配置文件的创建者，或说明他人可以如何使用它，就用这一项 — 在公开分享配置文件时很有用。\n\n它只是信息性内容，对色彩没有任何影响，所以大多数人可以放心地不启用它。\n\n示例: \"© 2026 你的名字。保留所有权利。\"",
 "An optional text label embedded in the .cal file header — not the filename.\nApplications that display .cal file information will show this string.\n\nUse it to identify the purpose of the calibration, for example:\n\"Epson P900 KCMY linearisation 2026-04\"\n\nIf left empty, no description is written to the header.": "嵌入 .cal 文件头的可选文字标签 — 不是文件名。\n显示 .cal 文件信息的应用会展示这个字符串。\n\n用它标明校准的用途，例如:\n\"Epson P900 KCMY linearisation 2026-04\"\n\n留空则不向文件头写入描述。",
 "Analyse Profile Quality": "分析配置文件质量",
 "Another process is already running.": "另一个进程已在运行。",
 "Appearance": "外观",
 "Appearance && Language": "外观与语言",
 "Append from file…": "从文件追加…",
 "Applies a colorimetric correction to convert between\nspectrophotometer calibration standards.\n\nDifferent instrument generations use slightly different white\nreferences. XRGA standardisation corrects for these offsets:\n\n  N = No correction   (default — use for modern instruments)\n  A = XRGA   (X-Rite Global Reference Architecture)\n  X = XRDI   (older X-Rite reference)\n  G = GMDI   (GretagMacbeth reference)\n\nOnly change this if you are combining measurements from\ninstruments of different generations or manufacturers.": "应用一个比色校正，用于在分光光度计校准标准之间转换。\n\n不同代的仪器使用略有差异的白基准。XRGA标准化可以校正\n这些偏移:\n\n  N = 无校正   （默认 — 现代仪器用这个）\n  A = XRGA   （X-Rite全球基准架构）\n  X = XRDI   （较老的X-Rite基准）\n  G = GMDI   （GretagMacbeth基准）\n\n只有在合并不同代或不同厂商仪器的测量时才需要改动。",
 "Applies additional smoothing to the computed calibration curves, which\nreduces the impact of measurement noise on the curve shape.\n\nDefault (1.0) is appropriate for most printers and well-controlled\nmeasurement conditions.\n\nRaise to 2–5 if your printer's tone response looks irregular — for example\nif a matte paper gave inconsistent density readings across patches.\nHeavier smoothing averages out these irregularities at the cost of slightly\nless precise curve fidelity.": "对计算出的校准曲线施加额外平滑，降低测量噪声对曲线形状\n的影响。\n\n默认值（1.0）适合大多数打印机和控制良好的测量条件。\n\n如果打印机的色调响应看起来不规则 — 例如哑光纸在各色块间\n给出不一致的密度读数 — 可调高到2〜5。更强的平滑会抹平这些\n不规则，但代价是曲线保真度略有下降。",
 "Applies gamut mapping in reverse on the A→B tables.\nHighly experimental — only use if you know exactly what this does.": "在A→B表上反向应用色域映射。\n高度实验性 — 只有完全清楚其作用时才使用。",
 "Applies only to ChromIQ's own printing pipeline (the default when the macOS printer dialog below is disabled).\n\nChromIQ first sends every chart as PostScript. Most home and photo printers do not understand PostScript, so macOS rejects it and ChromIQ resends the chart in another format:\n\n  • OFF — resend as a plain TIFF. macOS then decides the size itself and SHRINKS a full-page chart by about 3% so it fits inside the printer's margins. The printed patches end up slightly smaller and shifted compared to the on-screen layout.\n\n  • ON — resend as a PDF built by ChromIQ with the chart placed at exactly 100% scale. Anything that would fall into the printer's unprintable margin is simply cut off (charts keep white margins there, so nothing of value is lost). This matches how Apple's ColorSync Utility prints.\n\nColour is unaffected either way — both formats reach the printer without any colour conversion.\n\nGreyed out while the macOS printer dialog is enabled, because no fallback is involved on that path.": "仅作用于ChromIQ自己的打印管线（下方macOS打印对话框关闭时的默认路径）。\n\nChromIQ先把每张色卡以PostScript发送。大多数家用和照片打印机不认识PostScript，macOS会拒绝它，于是ChromIQ用另一种格式重发色卡:\n\n  • 关 — 以普通TIFF重发。macOS会自行决定尺寸，并把整页色卡缩小约3%以塞进打印机的页边距。打印出的色块会比屏幕上的布局略小且有偏移。\n\n  • 开 — 以ChromIQ生成的PDF重发，色卡严格按100%比例放置。落入打印机不可打印边距的部分会被直接裁掉（色卡在那里本就留白，不会损失有价值的内容）。这与Apple的ColorSync实用工具的打印方式一致。\n\n无论哪种方式色彩都不受影响 — 两种格式都不经任何颜色转换直达打印机。\n\nmacOS打印对话框启用时此项灰显，因为那条路径不涉及回退。",
 "Apply Calibration": "应用校准",
 "Apply Calibration  (applycal)": "应用校准 （applycal）",
 "Apply Calibration →": "应用校准 →",
 "Apply calibration to profile  (-a)": "将校准应用到配置文件 (-a)",
 "Apply: bakes the calibration curves into the ICC profile so\nthat any app using the profile automatically gets calibration.\n\nRemove: strips previously applied calibration curves out of\nthe profile, reverting it to its uncalibrated state.\n\nCheck: reports whether the profile has calibration curves\napplied, without modifying anything.": "应用: 把校准曲线写入ICC配置文件，任何使用该配置文件的\n应用都会自动获得校准。\n\n移除: 把之前应用的校准曲线从配置文件中剥离，恢复到未\n校准状态。\n\n检查: 报告配置文件是否已应用校准曲线，不做任何修改。",
