 "Auto-compute black patches (-B) from the chart's total\npatch count. Anchor: 560 patches → 4 blacks. Doubling the\ntotal adds 50 % to the count, capped at 8 (min 2).": "根据色卡总色块数自动计算黑色块 (-B)。基准: 560个色块\n→ 4个黑。总数翻倍则数量增加50%，上限8（下限2）。",
 "Auto-compute grey-axis steps (-g) from the chart's total\npatch count. Anchor: 560 patches → 32 steps. Doubling the\ntotal doubles the steps, capped at 128 (min 8).": "根据色卡总色块数自动计算灰轴级数 (-g)。基准: 560个色块\n→ 32级。总数翻倍则级数翻倍，上限128（下限8）。",
 "Auto-compute the patch count to fill exactly the number of\npages set under printtarg → Pages, using the current paper,\ninstrument, double-density, left-border, patch scale and margin.": "自动计算色块数，使其恰好填满printtarg → 页数中设置的\n页数，依据当前的纸张、仪器、双倍密度、左边条、色块缩放\n和页边距。",
 "Auto-compute white patches (-e) from the chart's total\npatch count. Anchor: 560 patches → 4 whites. Doubling the\ntotal adds 50 % to the count, capped at 8 (min 2).": "根据色卡总色块数自动计算白色块 (-e)。基准: 560个色块\n→ 4个白。总数翻倍则数量增加50%，上限8（下限2）。",
