 "Available when a Refine_Strips_<name>.txt file exists next\nto your .ti2 file.\n\nThat file is created automatically by the Check && Refine\ntab after a quality check. It lists the strips with the\nhighest colour errors, sorted worst-first.\n\nWhen active, the app navigates chartread to each of those\nstrips automatically — you only need to scan them.": "当 .ti2 文件旁存在 Refine_Strips_<name>.txt 文件时可用。\n\n该文件由检查与优化标签页在质量检查后自动创建，列出\n颜色误差最大的色条，按最差在前排序。\n\n启用时，应用会自动让chartread逐条导航到这些色条 —\n你只需要扫描它们。",
