 "Borderless Will Scale the Chart": "无边距会缩放色卡",
 "Borderless printing enlarges the page by a few percent so the ink reaches past the paper edges. The printer driver does this and it cannot be turned off — it is what borderless means.\n\nA profiling chart must print at exactly 100%: enlarging it shifts every patch, so the measurement reads the wrong positions.\n\nSwitch borderless off and print with borders instead — the chart's white margins are made for that.": "无边距打印会把页面放大几个百分点，让墨水越过纸边。这是打印机驱动做的，无法关闭 — 无边距的含义就是如此。\n\n配置文件色卡必须严格按100%打印: 放大会让每个色块移位，测量就会读到错误的位置。\n\n请关闭无边距，改用有边距打印 — 色卡的白边正是为此准备的。",
 "Browse for .ti3 file": "浏览 .ti3 文件",
 "Browse for ICC/ICM profile": "浏览ICC/ICM配置文件",
 "Browse for comparison ICC/ICM": "浏览用于对比的ICC/ICM",
 "Browse…": "浏览…",
 "Build ICC profile": "生成ICC配置文件",
 "Build Profile": "生成配置文件",
